# STM32F407VGTx pinout (LQFP100, U1)

| Pin | Pad | Function | Mux | Net | Config | Note |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| PA2 | 25 | USART2.TX | AF7 | UART_TX_DEBUG |  |  |
| PA3 | 26 | USART2.RX | AF7 | UART_RX_DEBUG | bias=pull_up |  |
| PA4 | 29 | gpio_out |  | IMU_CS | initial=high | SPI1 CS, active low |
| PA5 | 30 | SPI1.SCK | AF5 | IMU_SCK | speed=very_high |  |
| PA6 | 31 | SPI1.MISO | AF5 | IMU_MISO | speed=very_high |  |
| PA7 | 32 | SPI1.MOSI | AF5 | IMU_MOSI | speed=very_high |  |
| PA11 | 70 | OTG_FS.DM | AF10 | USB_D_N | bias=floating |  |
| PA12 | 71 | OTG_FS.DP | AF10 | USB_D_P | bias=floating |  |
| PA13 | 72 | reserved |  | SWDIO |  | SWD |
| PA14 | 76 | reserved |  | SWCLK |  | SWD |
| PB12 | 51 | gpio_in |  | BTN_USER | bias=pull_up |  |

## SPI1

IMU bus; CS is a GPIO on PA4

| Signal | Pin | Net |
|---|---|---|
| SCK | PA5 | IMU_SCK |
| MISO | PA6 | IMU_MISO |
| MOSI | PA7 | IMU_MOSI |

Properties:

- `spi-max-frequency = <8000000>`

## USART2

| Signal | Pin | Net |
|---|---|---|
| TX | PA2 | UART_TX_DEBUG |
| RX | PA3 | UART_RX_DEBUG |

Properties:

- `current-speed = <115200>`

## OTG_FS

USB full-speed device port

| Signal | Pin | Net |
|---|---|---|
| DM | PA11 | USB_D_N |
| DP | PA12 | USB_D_P |
